/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/27/2047950/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆はたるとんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁自分も2016年初めての海は江ノ島でした！\n江ノ島で美味しいもの食べましたかー？♪(๑ᴖ◡ᴖ๑)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎わー！同じですねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味しらす丼とお刺身盛りと\n揚げ物を食べました！！\nあと、おまんじゅう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆いなかもんじろうさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁京都個握では何かコスプレ予定ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎13枚目の京都は私服だけだけど、\n14枚目の名古屋と京都では\n天使と悪魔するよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人でだけど。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆たいがさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今度ラジオや撮影で一緒になりたいメンバーは誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ラジオでは、飛鳥ちゃんと伊織とやってみたいです！！！楽しそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆おがっがーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ご飯が1番すすむおかずはなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ズバリ！！！うなぎです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆みいめろさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ひなは来年成人式だけど\nこの色が着たい！っていうのある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎プライベートの振袖は\nもう決めたよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆もうすぐ30歳さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁【もうすぐ30歳】で投稿してから、結構時間が流れました。あと３週間ぐらいで30歳...日奈子さんは、30歳になったら何をしてるんでしょう！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎何をやってるんでしょうね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をしていても、きっと幸せなんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかアイドルじゃなくなった時に\nアイドルでいた時の私を思い出しては\n幸せに思うと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうやって思えるのは皆さんのおかげです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひなたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁「幕張の握手会で日奈子のセーラ服に対抗して学ランで行きたいなって思ってます。春から大学生の僕が学ラン着ていっても大丈夫でしょうか？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いいねいいね٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪\n待ってるよ(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆名古屋の植民地の熊さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今度個握で学ラン着て欲しいな！\nめっちゃみてみたい！！！\nセーラ服っていうのもいいな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎セーラ服は14枚目の最初の幕張個別握手会で着るんだけど、\n学ランねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thシングル 個人PVにでてきた\nドラゴン剣に取り憑かれた「北野くん」\n以来だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、学ランって用意するの難しそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆カズさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは鎌倉の大仏様の中はいったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎前に家族で鎌倉に行ったときに\n大仏様の方にも観光しに行って\n大仏様の中に入ったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆だっちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今1番食べたい物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎スイカ！！！の次にうなぎ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆きょさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは堀ちゃんの髪ロングとショートどっちがすきですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ロングの未央奈も可愛かったけど\nショートの未央奈の方が未央奈らしくて\n私は好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ゆーだいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁乃木のので出てた話題ですが、きいちゃんは結局いつ車の免許を取るんですか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん！いつだろう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、もうちょっと先かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、車乗れるようになったら\n便利そう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家から最寄り駅まで\n仕事帰りのお父さんのこと迎えに行けるし\nお母さんと2人でお買い物にも行ける！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/27/2047950/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は今日よりも多めに\nセレクトします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は時間なかったです(ノ_・。)ごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/27/2047950/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップちゃーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako